## Panel 4 — Payment & Commission

**Overview KPI Row:**
- Total advance payments received (period selector)
- Total commission earned (period selector)
- Total owner payouts pending
- Total revenue

**Transaction Log Table:**
| Date | Booking ID | Service | Customer | Amount | Advance | Commission | Net | Status |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|

**Filters:** Date range | Service type | Payment method | Status (paid/unpaid)

**Export Button:** "Export CSV" — downloads filtered data

**Revenue Report:**
- Monthly bar chart: Revenue vs. Commission
- Table: Month | Total Bookings | Total Revenue | Commission | Owner Payouts

---

## Panel 5 — Subscription Management

### Plans List
- Table of all subscription plans
- Columns: Plan Name | Price | Duration | Car Limit | Commission Rate | Status (Active/Inactive) | Actions

### Create/Edit Plan (Modal or dedicated page)

| Field | Type |
|---|---|
| Plan Name | Text input (e.g. "Free", "Premium", "Business") |
| Price | Number input (BDT) |
| Duration | Number input + dropdown (days / months) |
| Max Cars | Number input (0 = unlimited) |
| Visibility Priority | Number (higher = shown first in search) |
| Commission Rate | Number input (%) |
| Features | Repeating text field ("Add Feature" button — each becomes a bullet point) |
| Active Status | Toggle |

### Business Subscription Status Table
- Columns: Owner/Business | Plan | Started | Expires | Status | Action
- Filters: Active / Expired / Expiring Soon (≤7 days)
- "Send Renewal Reminder" manual button per row

### Auto-Downgrade Logic:
- When subscription expires → cron job downgrades `visibility_priority` to 0 (base level)
- Cars remain active (not suspended), just lose priority placement in search results

---

## Panel 6 — Service & Content Management

### Service Categories
- List of 6 services with toggles: Active / Inactive (disabling hides from homepage)
- Edit service: name, description, icon (upload), order (drag to reorder)
- "Add New Service" button (future expansion)

### Homepage Banner Management
- Current banner image (preview)
- Upload new banner image
- Edit banner headline text
- Edit banner subtext
- "Publish Changes" button

### Pricing Guidelines (optional)
- Table: Car Type | Service | Estimated Rate | Per (hour/trip/day)
- Admin can edit these — shown as guidance to customers on booking confirmation

---

## Panel 7 — Customer Management

**Customer List Table:**
| Name | Phone | Email | Total Bookings | Joined | Last Active | Action |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|

**Search:** By name, phone, email

**Customer Detail Page:**
- Profile info
- Booking history (linked booking detail views)
- All reviews submitted
- "Block Customer" button (prevents login) — for abuse cases

**Complaints/Feedback Tab:**
- All complaints submitted via contact forms or post-trip feedback
- Status: Open / Resolved
- Reply text area + "Mark Resolved" button

---

## Panel 8 — Notifications

### Notification Settings
- Toggle: Admin email notification when new booking comes in
- Toggle: Admin email notification when new registration request submitted
- Toggle: SMS to customer on booking confirmed
- Toggle: SMS to customer when trip starts
- Toggle: SMS to customer when trip completes
- Toggle: SMS to owner on new booking assigned

### Notification Log
- Table of all sent notifications: Date | Type | Recipient | Message | Status (Sent/Failed)

