## Panel 9 — Roles & Access (Future Phase)

**Current MVP:** Single admin account, no sub-roles.

**Planned structure (build schema now, UI later):**

| Role | Access |
|---|---|
| Super Admin | Everything |
| Booking Manager | Panel 3 (bookings) only |
| Finance Manager | Panel 4 (payments) only |
| Support Agent | Panel 7 (customers) only |

**Staff Management (placeholder page for now):**
- "Staff management will be available in a future update."
- Schema already supports roles in `users` table — no rebuild needed later.
